WEBVTT

00:02.350 --> 00:05.520
<b><i>I wake up in the morning and sigh.</i></b>

00:06.190 --> 00:09.780
<b><i>Somewhere along the way,
that became a habit of mine.</i></b>

00:14.320 --> 00:15.360
<b><i>I was sure that love...</i></b>

00:19.620 --> 00:22.750
<b><i>was supposed to be more fun than this.</i></b>

01:59.930 --> 02:00.800
<b>Wow.</b>

02:01.470 --> 02:02.930
<b>You're exactly on time.</b>

02:03.640 --> 02:07.270
<b>I didn't realize
that I got here early. Sorry.</b>

02:07.270 --> 02:08.190
<b>It's all right.</b>

02:12.770 --> 02:14.020
<b><i>I'm sure that...</i></b>

02:14.900 --> 02:18.280
<b><i>the next thing that happens
will be me getting rejected.</i></b>

02:21.700 --> 02:22.530
<b>You see, I...</b>

02:23.120 --> 02:27.290
<b>I've liked you since we were first-years.
Did you know?</b>

02:28.580 --> 02:29.460
<b>No.</b>

02:29.460 --> 02:30.540
<b>Didn't think so.</b>

02:31.210 --> 02:33.250
<b>I was hiding it so you wouldn't catch on.</b>

02:33.750 --> 02:36.050
<b>"Please don't let him
find out how I feel."</b>

02:36.260 --> 02:37.970
<b>That was the only thing on my mind.</b>

02:39.050 --> 02:40.630
<b><i>I'm sure that today...</i></b>

02:41.140 --> 02:42.800
<b><i>will be the last time.</i></b>

02:43.390 --> 02:46.100
<b>But this morning,
it hit me when I woke up,</b>

02:46.100 --> 02:50.440
<b>that I don't have to pretend
that I don't like you anymore.</b>

02:51.150 --> 02:53.310
<b>And that gave me some relief.</b>

02:55.520 --> 02:58.650
<b>That's why I have no regrets.</b>

03:04.120 --> 03:06.120
<b>I just want you
to listen to me for a while.</b>

03:06.120 --> 03:06.950
<b>Right.</b>

03:07.540 --> 03:10.870
<b>See, I really like
the way you play, Yamada.</b>

03:12.000 --> 03:13.170
<b>I'm talking about gaming.</b>

03:13.790 --> 03:16.710
<b>You're so coolheaded,
and you don't blame other people.</b>

03:16.710 --> 03:17.710
<b>Uh, yeah.</b>

03:18.210 --> 03:23.390
<b>A lot of players lose it during PvP games,
but you never show any signs of that.</b>

03:23.390 --> 03:24.220
<b>Uh...</b>

03:24.850 --> 03:27.770
<b>And I really admired
how mature you are in that way.</b>

03:28.100 --> 03:29.060
<b>Thanks.</b>

03:29.060 --> 03:31.520
<b>I also like the way
you're always looking out the window</b>

03:31.520 --> 03:33.270
<b>when you're spacing out in the classroom.</b>

03:34.190 --> 03:35.360
<b>And I could never tell you,</b>

03:35.360 --> 03:37.570
<b>because I didn't want you
to think I was a fangirl,</b>

03:37.570 --> 03:40.360
<b>but the truth is, I always thought
you were super good-looking,</b>

03:40.360 --> 03:42.820
<b>and I love the way you never show off.</b>

03:42.820 --> 03:45.530
<b>Oh, and I also love your voice.
It really calms me down.</b>

03:45.660 --> 03:46.950
<b>And I like how quiet you are.</b>

03:46.950 --> 03:49.250
<b>I like seeing you walk
and also seeing you run,</b>

03:49.580 --> 03:51.120
<b>and I like how you're a slow talker.</b>

03:51.120 --> 03:54.120
<b>You know your habit of blinking like crazy
when you're at a loss?</b>

03:54.120 --> 03:56.460
<b>That. I've always liked that, too.</b>

03:56.460 --> 03:59.170
<b>And I really like
how you're equally kind to everyone.</b>

04:00.550 --> 04:05.050
<b>Over the last three years, I'm sure
that a lot of girls have fallen for you,</b>

04:05.050 --> 04:06.260
<b>but any way you look at it,</b>

04:06.260 --> 04:09.060
<b>I'm sure that I've always liked you
more than anyone else.</b>

04:10.850 --> 04:11.890
<b>No question.</b>

04:14.190 --> 04:18.690
<b>I've always liked you
more than anyone else in the world!</b>

04:26.450 --> 04:28.740
<b><i>I can't really see him.</i></b>

04:31.120 --> 04:34.620
<b><i>But I managed to tell him everything.</i></b>

04:35.540 --> 04:38.000
<b><i>For so long, it felt like a lead weight.</i></b>

04:39.130 --> 04:41.130
<b><i>It's been stressing me out all this time.</i></b>

04:43.050 --> 04:46.720
<b><i>So I absolutely have no regrets.</i></b>

04:48.760 --> 04:50.560
<b>What a relief!</b>

05:00.400 --> 05:02.990
<b>Ms. Tsubaki, I...</b>

05:05.780 --> 05:07.320
<b>Ms. Tsubaki, I can't...</b>

05:08.660 --> 05:10.160
<b>return your feelings.</b>

05:16.250 --> 05:17.080
<b>Right.</b>

05:22.380 --> 05:24.670
<b>Sorry. I...</b>

05:27.380 --> 05:29.600
<b>There's something on your hand.</b>

05:30.760 --> 05:33.640
<b>Huh? Oh. This is...</b>

05:36.270 --> 05:39.270
<b>IT'S HER IN-GAME CHARACTER
IN OIL-BASED INK...</b>

05:36.730 --> 05:38.770
<b>Someone I know was joking around.</b>

05:40.190 --> 05:43.030
<b>I know the person who drew that.</b>

05:47.240 --> 05:51.490
<b>It's the person you like...</b>

05:52.450 --> 05:53.290
<b>right?</b>

06:04.300 --> 06:05.460
<b>Yes.</b>

06:09.970 --> 06:13.140
<b>Thank you for having feelings for me.</b>

06:14.970 --> 06:18.100
<b>I'm sorry that I can't feel
the same way about you.</b>

06:21.690 --> 06:22.610
<b>It's all right.</b>

06:23.440 --> 06:25.280
<b>I'm glad that you heard me out.</b>

06:27.400 --> 06:29.030
<b>I'm glad that I was able to tell you.</b>

06:31.820 --> 06:32.950
<b><i>I've known all along.</i></b>

06:35.450 --> 06:36.950
<b><i>Because I've been watching you.</i></b>

06:38.660 --> 06:42.710
<b><i>I could tell that you'd changed,
just a little.</i></b>

06:44.460 --> 06:46.300
<b><i>Even if nobody else noticed...</i></b>

06:51.050 --> 06:52.600
<b><i>I could tell right away.</i></b>

06:57.600 --> 06:59.640
<b>That was a relief,
getting it all off my chest.</b>

07:00.190 --> 07:02.400
<b>Thanks for making time for me.</b>

07:03.770 --> 07:05.770
<b>I'll be heading home now.</b>

07:06.530 --> 07:08.150
<b>All right, see you at school.</b>

07:10.650 --> 07:12.990
<b>Uh, do you want me to walk you home?</b>

07:13.490 --> 07:15.700
<b>You're not wearing your glasses,
and it's dark.</b>

07:16.120 --> 07:16.950
<b>It's fine.</b>

07:16.950 --> 07:18.700
<b>- I can go home by myself.
- But—</b>

07:19.580 --> 07:22.920
<b>Don't worry. I'm not that weak.</b>

07:28.630 --> 07:29.470
<b>Right.</b>

07:31.760 --> 07:32.800
<b><i>Thanks.</i></b>

07:37.180 --> 07:40.770
<b><i>You were so nice to me right to the end.
That made me happy.</i></b>

07:42.060 --> 07:44.310
<b><i>That's what I really liked about you.</i></b>

07:50.150 --> 07:51.490
<b><i>I really liked you, you know.</i></b>

07:56.990 --> 07:58.950
<b>We'll be going on break soon,</b>

07:58.950 --> 08:01.330
<b>but I don't know
what my work schedule will be like.</b>

08:01.870 --> 08:03.460
<b>What, it's noisy?</b>

08:03.460 --> 08:05.710
<b>Sorry. I'm getting ready
to leave the house.</b>

08:06.290 --> 08:08.210
<b>For a guild meetup.</b>

08:08.210 --> 08:10.210
<b>No, not a club!</b>

08:10.210 --> 08:16.720
<b>To everyone in Chocolate Rabbit
Mr. Kamota will be hosting a guild meeting
on December X at a barbecue restaurant
(Please see attached details and map)
If you can make it, please let Rurihime know ASAP</b>

08:10.840 --> 08:12.550
<b>I explained it before.</b>

08:12.550 --> 08:13.680
<b>My gaming friends.</b>

08:14.180 --> 08:15.470
<b>That's right.</b>

08:15.470 --> 08:17.930
<b>I'm going out to dinner with them.</b>

08:21.980 --> 08:23.730
<b>YAKINIKU TAKOU</b>

08:23.730 --> 08:27.020
<b>Hey, I think she's here. Over there!</b>

08:27.020 --> 08:27.860
<b>Hey, you're right!</b>

08:27.860 --> 08:30.360
<b>RUNA</b>

08:28.230 --> 08:29.780
<b>Akane!</b>

08:30.990 --> 08:31.820
<b>Mr. Kamota!</b>

08:31.820 --> 08:33.700
<b>- Long time no see!
- What meat do you want?</b>

08:33.700 --> 08:35.070
<b>- Thanks for coming!
- Kalbi!</b>

08:35.070 --> 08:36.320
<b>- Kalbi!
- No, no, thank you!</b>

08:36.320 --> 08:38.740
<b>- Thank you so much for inviting me.
- What kind? Kalbi?</b>

08:39.200 --> 08:40.620
<b>Sure, I could go for some kalbi.</b>

08:40.620 --> 08:42.200
<b>I want kalbi, too!</b>

08:41.790 --> 08:43.870
<b><i>Hey, Yamada's not here.</i></b>

08:42.200 --> 08:43.870
<b>Kalbi! Kalbi!</b>

08:43.870 --> 08:45.880
<b>HE SAYS HE
HAS AN ERRAND
AT SCHOOL</b>

08:43.870 --> 08:45.880
<b>Kalbi! Kalbi! Kalbi!</b>

08:43.870 --> 08:45.880
<b>Akito will be here later.</b>

08:46.250 --> 08:47.250
<b>Yo!</b>

08:47.250 --> 08:49.460
<b>You scared me. Yo!</b>

08:49.960 --> 08:52.260
<b>Want me to arrange
some one-on-one time with him?</b>

08:52.880 --> 08:55.890
<b>He's been busy, so you don't get
to see each other that much, right?</b>

08:55.890 --> 08:59.890
<b>THE OTHER DAY</b>

08:55.890 --> 08:59.890
<b>HUH?</b>

08:56.430 --> 08:59.890
<b><i>Oh, darn, I couldn't tell him
how I felt the other day!</i></b>

09:00.100 --> 09:01.560
<b>No, that's okay.</b>

09:01.560 --> 09:03.390
<b>I came here to have some meat today!</b>

09:03.600 --> 09:04.850
<b>Welcome!</b>

09:05.520 --> 09:07.520
<b>I have a reservation
under the name Kamota.</b>

09:05.900 --> 09:08.400
<b>- IS IT TRUE THAT MR. KAMOTA'S
TREATING US TODAY?</b>

09:07.520 --> 09:09.900
<b>We've been waiting for you, Mr. Kamota.</b>

09:08.400 --> 09:09.900
<b>- IS IT TRUE THAT MR. KAMOTA'S
TREATING US TODAY?
- IT'S TRUE</b>

09:10.570 --> 09:15.320
<b>Besides, Yamada seems
a little tired lately.</b>

09:15.700 --> 09:18.490
<b>I think it must be the stress
of studying for his entrance exams.</b>

09:18.490 --> 09:20.030
<b>I'm sure that's not it.</b>

09:20.660 --> 09:23.580
<b>That guy's ready
to coast through entrance exams.</b>

09:23.580 --> 09:24.790
<b>What, really?</b>

09:25.540 --> 09:28.790
<b><i>Then I guess I was
just imagining things the other day.</i></b>

09:28.790 --> 09:30.670
<b>ISN'T IT KIND OF DARK IN HERE!?</b>

09:28.790 --> 09:30.670
<b>This place looks expensive!</b>

09:30.790 --> 09:32.460
<b>I wonder if the meat's expensive here?</b>

09:32.460 --> 09:34.260
<b>Runa, try to keep your voice down, okay?</b>

09:34.260 --> 09:36.010
<b>MEAT LOVER
MEAT LOVER</b>

09:34.380 --> 09:35.380
<b>But why?</b>

09:36.470 --> 09:39.430
<b>My friend runs this place.</b>

09:39.430 --> 09:41.760
<b>He just opened it the other day.</b>

09:42.140 --> 09:44.180
<b>He's been asking me to come,</b>

09:44.180 --> 09:47.100
<b>so I thought it would be great
to come with my guildmates.</b>

09:47.100 --> 09:48.400
<b>Is that right?</b>

09:48.770 --> 09:51.020
<b>You sure know a lot of people,
Mr. Kamota.</b>

09:51.770 --> 09:53.400
<b>- President Kamota!
- Huh?</b>

09:53.730 --> 09:54.900
<b>It's been a long time.</b>

09:55.280 --> 09:58.200
<b>Inoue! You look like you're doing well!</b>

09:58.200 --> 10:00.280
<b>Yes, sir!
And you're looking well yourself!</b>

10:00.820 --> 10:02.790
<b>How's business these days?</b>

10:02.790 --> 10:04.580
<b>Thank you for asking. We're managing.</b>

10:04.580 --> 10:06.160
<b>Hey, President Kamota!</b>

10:06.160 --> 10:07.500
<b>I didn't know you were here.</b>

10:07.500 --> 10:10.540
<b>Ah, what a surprise, Professor Obayashi!</b>

10:10.750 --> 10:12.670
<b>President Kamota! What a coincidence!</b>

10:12.670 --> 10:15.050
<b>Well, well! Hello there, Director Nagaoka.</b>

10:15.050 --> 10:17.090
<b>Oh, Mr. Kamota! What a surprise!</b>

10:17.090 --> 10:19.800
<b>President Sumiyoshi's wife? Hello!</b>

10:19.930 --> 10:22.680
<b>Who would have thought, right?</b>

10:22.680 --> 10:25.180
<b>No way. That's knowing
way too many people.</b>

10:25.180 --> 10:26.680
<b>Who is he?</b>

10:28.140 --> 10:31.190
<b>Hey! We've got a private room!</b>

10:37.950 --> 10:39.950
<b>This meat's delicious!</b>

10:37.950 --> 10:43.450
<b>TIED HER HAIR
BACK TO EAT
IN EARNEST</b>

10:37.950 --> 10:43.450
<b>IT'S MELTING IN MY MOUTH</b>

10:39.950 --> 10:41.660
<b>Doesn't it taste
even better</b>

10:41.660 --> 10:43.450
<b>when you're with
a lot of people?</b>

10:43.830 --> 10:47.500
<b>Though it's too bad
that the new player couldn't make it.</b>

10:47.500 --> 10:50.500
<b>I did invite her, but it seems
like tonight didn't work for her.</b>

10:50.500 --> 10:52.380
<b>No need for her to come!</b>

10:53.420 --> 10:54.960
<b>Excuse me.</b>

10:57.920 --> 11:01.340
<b>Mr. Inoue from across the hall
sent this over.</b>

11:01.340 --> 11:03.350
<b>ULTRA-PREMIUM SAKE</b>

11:01.340 --> 11:03.350
<b>This is from Mr. Obayashi.</b>

11:03.550 --> 11:05.350
<b>This is from Mr. Nagaoka.</b>

11:05.470 --> 11:08.100
<b>And this is from Mrs. Sumiyoshi.</b>

11:10.600 --> 11:13.610
<b>NOW I FEEL BAD</b>

11:11.270 --> 11:13.610
<b>Oh, no. Did I make them feel obligated?</b>

11:13.610 --> 11:15.610
<b>WOW</b>

11:13.610 --> 11:15.610
<b>HEY, YOU'RE TOTALLY POPULAR!!</b>

11:13.770 --> 11:15.610
<b>There's even sake! Amazing!</b>

11:15.820 --> 11:18.940
<b><i>I've never seen other customers
send over stuff.</i></b>

11:15.980 --> 11:23.370
<b>EXPENSIVE-LOOKING SAKE...</b>

11:18.940 --> 11:23.370
<b>Lucky you! Someday, I want to become
a big-shot grown-up like you!</b>

11:21.990 --> 11:23.370
<b>SO COOL</b>

11:24.620 --> 11:28.750
<b>HAVE SOME MEAT</b>

11:24.950 --> 11:28.750
<b>What are you talking about?
You're already a fine young man!</b>

11:29.290 --> 11:32.790
<b>The reason I'm able to hunt
without a care in the dungeons</b>

11:32.790 --> 11:37.550
<b>is because you've taken on all
of the guild management duties for me.</b>

11:38.050 --> 11:41.340
<b>RETURNING THE FAVOR</b>

11:38.300 --> 11:41.340
<b>That's because I have your support
behind the scenes!</b>

11:41.340 --> 11:43.720
<b>Oh, I wouldn't say that!</b>

11:41.340 --> 11:44.350
<b>THE MEAT'S DELISH</b>

11:43.720 --> 11:47.600
<b>You're always creating
fun places to hang out</b>

11:47.600 --> 11:50.430
<b>and bringing in great friends
for me to meet,</b>

11:50.430 --> 11:53.730
<b>so I'm really enjoying each and every day.</b>

11:53.730 --> 11:58.690
<b>I hope we can all keep playing
as good friends.</b>

12:00.030 --> 12:04.030
<b>I hear you! I want to keep playing with
our current members forever, like always!</b>

12:04.030 --> 12:05.320
<b>The current members!</b>

12:06.530 --> 12:08.910
<b><i>Forever... like always.</i></b>

12:09.700 --> 12:12.210
<b>Yeah, but we do need change, you know.</b>

12:12.290 --> 12:18.670
<b>THE MEAT'S READY</b>

12:12.670 --> 12:15.290
<b>Going forward, we'll be embracing renewal.</b>

12:15.290 --> 12:18.670
<b>Huh? I'm totally opposed to that!
Why can't things stay the way they are?</b>

12:18.840 --> 12:20.170
<b>Don't fear change!</b>

12:20.670 --> 12:23.050
<b>Excuse me, but that's
the meat that Runa was grilling!</b>

12:23.220 --> 12:24.590
<b>Right, that's what you think.</b>

12:24.590 --> 12:28.720
<b>But since I'm the one who raised Runa,
it's actually the kalbi that I grilled.</b>

12:28.720 --> 12:30.180
<b>Eita, you suck!</b>

12:36.730 --> 12:37.940
<b>Welcome!</b>

12:38.570 --> 12:40.320
<b>You're with Mr. Kamota, aren't you?</b>

12:38.940 --> 12:42.440
<b>WOW, HE'S HOT</b>

12:40.820 --> 12:42.440
<b>Please follow me.</b>

12:43.700 --> 12:45.700
<b>Hey! The attendant's here!</b>

12:45.700 --> 12:49.580
<b>ATTEND...?</b>

12:46.370 --> 12:48.080
<b>Akkun, you're late!</b>

12:48.080 --> 12:48.910
<b>Yo.</b>

12:48.910 --> 12:51.540
<b>- We've been waiting for you, Akito!
- Yamada! Listen up!</b>

12:51.910 --> 12:54.160
<b>Just now, Runa was really in a bind!</b>

12:54.580 --> 12:58.040
<b>- You said you could get here sooner.
- I'm talking really, really big trouble!</b>

12:56.960 --> 12:58.040
<b>Well, uh...</b>

12:58.040 --> 13:00.670
<b>- There's so many kinds of meat!
- Runa was really in a bind!</b>

13:01.670 --> 13:03.420
<b>If you all talk at once...</b>

13:05.890 --> 13:07.340
<b>Uh-oh! She's back!</b>

13:07.340 --> 13:08.180
<b>Huh?</b>

13:11.060 --> 13:12.930
<b>Hey...</b>

13:12.930 --> 13:15.440
<b>it's Yamada!</b>

13:17.100 --> 13:17.940
<b>What...</b>

13:21.230 --> 13:23.530
<b>Why is she so intoxicated?</b>

13:23.530 --> 13:30.030
<b>I'M SO SORRY...</b>

13:23.820 --> 13:28.530
<b>It's my fault for urging her to taste
the sake someone gave us as a gift.</b>

13:28.530 --> 13:30.030
<b>It's not your fault, Mr. Kamota!</b>

13:30.240 --> 13:33.040
<b>It's Akane's fault
for guzzling it like crazy!</b>

13:33.540 --> 13:42.920
<b>RUNA, LET'S
TRY TO LEARN
TO WELCOME
OTHERS, OKAY</b>

13:34.000 --> 13:38.080
<b>And she kept bugging me in that
hyper mood, which was really annoying!</b>

13:35.460 --> 13:41.800
<b>IT'S SERIOUSLY
ANNOYING</b>

13:38.080 --> 13:42.000
<b>Akane's the type who gets
really cheerful when she drinks, huh?</b>

13:43.130 --> 13:45.050
<b>Yamada, I'm leaving the rest to you.</b>

13:45.050 --> 13:48.050
<b>If she gets on your nerves,
you can leave her on the restroom floor.</b>

13:48.050 --> 13:49.680
<b>That's what Runa did!</b>

13:49.680 --> 13:51.560
<b>No, I couldn't do that.</b>

13:51.850 --> 13:55.020
<b>Akito! Sit down, and let's have dinner.</b>

13:55.020 --> 13:57.940
<b>I'll send Akane home in a taxi later,
so no worries!</b>

13:58.190 --> 13:59.520
<b>No need! No need!</b>

13:59.520 --> 14:02.440
<b>I'll have Akito take Akanecchi home,
so it's all good.</b>

14:02.610 --> 14:03.570
<b>Really?</b>

14:03.570 --> 14:04.530
<b>Sure, sure.</b>

14:04.530 --> 14:07.910
<b>Well, you're right.
Those two are really close.</b>

14:05.440 --> 14:06.820
<b>How are you doing?!</b>

14:07.910 --> 14:10.120
<b>So I guess it would be better
to leave it to him?</b>

14:12.370 --> 14:13.410
<b>Come on.</b>

14:14.410 --> 14:16.620
<b>You're so late... Yamara.</b>

14:18.920 --> 14:20.000
<b>Sorry.</b>

14:21.540 --> 14:23.050
<b>Yummy!</b>

14:23.050 --> 14:24.300
<b>AFTER DRINKING, RECYCLE</b>

14:24.630 --> 14:27.470
<b>Hey, maybe we should
just pick someone up now?</b>

14:27.470 --> 14:28.300
<b>I'd be up for that!</b>

14:28.590 --> 14:30.510
<b>Are there any cute girls around?</b>

14:36.100 --> 14:36.930
<b>Huh?</b>

14:37.730 --> 14:38.560
<b>Here's some water.</b>

14:38.810 --> 14:40.060
<b>Huh? Oh, crap!</b>

14:40.060 --> 14:42.440
<b>- Was I sleeping here right now?
- Yes.</b>

14:42.940 --> 14:44.230
<b>I can't believe it!</b>

14:44.230 --> 14:45.190
<b>Neither can I.</b>

14:46.990 --> 14:48.900
<b>Whoa! Some water!</b>

14:48.900 --> 14:50.740
<b>I was feeling really parched right now.</b>

14:50.740 --> 14:52.740
<b>How'd you know that I wanted some water?</b>

14:52.740 --> 14:55.240
<b>Because you were making
a commotion about it in song form.</b>

14:55.240 --> 14:56.080
<b>What?</b>

14:56.080 --> 14:58.870
<b>My throat is totally dry!</b>

14:58.870 --> 15:01.960
<b>Is this the desert, maybe?</b>

15:02.210 --> 15:10.220
<b>SORRY TO MAKE YOU GO
THROUGH THIS EVERY TIME</b>

15:02.670 --> 15:04.420
<b>Sorry to make trouble for you!</b>

15:04.420 --> 15:06.800
<b>I'm going to try to make sure
not to forget this favor!</b>

15:06.800 --> 15:09.680
<b>When I'm drunk, I hardly
remember anything afterwards.</b>

15:09.680 --> 15:10.760
<b>- Right.
- I know!</b>

15:10.760 --> 15:11.590
<b>I'll make a note!</b>

15:11.590 --> 15:13.850
<b>If I leave a record on my phone,
I know I'll be set!</b>

15:13.390 --> 15:16.720
<b>CAN YOU KEEP YOUR VOICE DOWN?</b>

15:13.850 --> 15:15.680
<b>It's okay to forget,
so let's just go home.</b>

15:15.680 --> 15:16.720
<b>It's getting late.</b>

15:16.890 --> 15:18.390
<b>Hey, you're right.</b>

15:18.390 --> 15:19.770
<b>Just look at the time.</b>

15:19.940 --> 15:22.270
<b>Hey, Yamada, you can go now.</b>

15:22.270 --> 15:24.400
<b>Coming back to my place
would be a hassle for you.</b>

15:24.400 --> 15:26.030
<b>It's not safe, so I'm taking you home.</b>

15:26.400 --> 15:28.400
<b>There are tons of drunks around here.</b>

15:29.900 --> 15:31.410
<b>Aside from you.</b>

15:49.720 --> 15:50.550
<b>Whoa.</b>

15:51.340 --> 15:54.010
<b>Sorry. My heel got stuck in a groove.</b>

15:54.010 --> 15:54.850
<b>Huh?</b>

15:59.350 --> 16:01.810
<b>Uh-oh, can't get it out.</b>

16:04.400 --> 16:05.360
<b>Um...</b>

16:05.860 --> 16:08.730
<b>sorry about this,
making you go to so much trouble.</b>

16:08.730 --> 16:10.610
<b>It's stuck in the ground.</b>

16:20.410 --> 16:21.250
<b>I got it—</b>

16:42.560 --> 16:43.390
<b>Ready to go?</b>

16:46.520 --> 16:48.690
<b>Uh... yes.</b>

17:12.210 --> 17:15.970
<b>Well, then, I'll be going now.
Good night, then.</b>

17:16.470 --> 17:17.300
<b>Thanks!</b>

17:17.800 --> 17:19.260
<b>Get home safely, all right?</b>

17:25.350 --> 17:26.190
<b>Hey...</b>

17:27.400 --> 17:29.400
<b>Uh... um...</b>

17:30.320 --> 17:33.820
<b>Y-Yamada, do you l-like me?</b>

17:37.200 --> 17:38.030
<b>What?</b>

17:38.950 --> 17:41.040
<b>No, it's just...</b>

17:41.330 --> 17:42.500
<b>What?</b>

17:42.500 --> 17:44.500
<b>I just had a feeling...</b>

17:45.540 --> 17:46.790
<b><i>Because...</i></b>

17:47.710 --> 17:48.540
<b><i>his hand...</i></b>

17:53.710 --> 17:54.550
<b>I'm busted, huh?</b>

17:57.720 --> 17:59.300
<b><i>When his hand touched mine...</i></b>

17:59.800 --> 18:01.430
<b>Uh... um...</b>

18:02.850 --> 18:05.430
<b><i>...the whole time, it seemed
like he was telling me that.</i></b>

18:09.900 --> 18:12.320
<b>I'm drunk right now.</b>

18:12.820 --> 18:15.440
<b>Uh, am I talking normally?</b>

18:15.780 --> 18:17.070
<b>What I meant to say—</b>

18:17.070 --> 18:18.110
<b>I like you.</b>

18:19.200 --> 18:22.200
<b>I like you, Akane.</b>

18:23.950 --> 18:27.120
<b>In the morning, when you wake up,
if you've forgotten, that's okay.</b>

18:29.040 --> 18:30.380
<b>I'll come by to say it again...</b>

18:31.790 --> 18:33.130
<b>until you remember what I said.</b>

18:36.300 --> 18:37.300
<b>Good night.</b>

18:47.270 --> 18:48.440
<b>Tomorrow...</b>

18:49.600 --> 18:51.360
<b>AFRO YAMADA?</b>

18:50.480 --> 18:51.360
<b>morning...</b>

18:51.360 --> 18:53.610
<b>WHO ARE YOU?</b>

18:52.150 --> 18:53.070
<b>when I wake up...</b>

18:57.900 --> 18:59.700
<b>is it okay if I call you?</b>

19:00.870 --> 19:03.870
<b>WELL, ROMANCE
ISN'T ALL FUN AND
GAMES, EITHER</b>

19:02.490 --> 19:04.830
<b>Because I know I'm going to worry...</b>

19:06.250 --> 19:08.830
<b>that it was all a dream.</b>

19:09.370 --> 19:11.380
<b>THAT REALLY SUCKS</b>

19:14.340 --> 19:17.550
<b>Is it okay... if I do that?</b>

19:25.930 --> 19:26.930
<b>I'll call you.</b>

19:29.690 --> 19:30.520
<b>Tomorrow.</b>

19:37.360 --> 19:39.820
<b>In the morning when you wake up.</b>

19:42.620 --> 19:44.120
<b>Episode 13:
IN THE MORNING WHEN I WAKE UP</b>

19:50.870 --> 19:51.870
<b>ALARM
SNOOZE
STOP</b>

19:58.800 --> 20:00.760
<b>AKITO YAMADA</b>

20:02.090 --> 20:02.930
<b>Yes?</b>

20:03.680 --> 20:04.890
<b><i>Good morning.</i></b>

20:05.260 --> 20:06.260
<b>Morning!</b>

20:06.260 --> 20:07.600
<b>SHE DIDN'T SLEEP AT ALL</b>

20:07.060 --> 20:08.680
<b>So? And then what? And then what?</b>

20:08.680 --> 20:11.230
<b>What did you talk about over the phone?
Tell me everything!</b>

20:11.230 --> 20:12.480
<b>Every single word,
verbatim!</b>

20:12.480 --> 20:14.100
<b>Come on,
that's private.</b>

20:14.860 --> 20:16.860
<b>What? You have
a boyfriend now?</b>

20:16.860 --> 20:18.320
<b>Good for you!</b>

20:19.150 --> 20:22.110
<b><i>Wait! Could it be that I'm the only one
among us without a boyfriend?</i></b>

20:22.110 --> 20:25.490
<b>GROUP DATE
GROUP DATE</b>

20:22.110 --> 20:25.490
<b>DESPITE ALL
MY DAILY EFFORTS?</b>

20:22.490 --> 20:24.450
<b>Wow, so he's younger!</b>

20:22.570 --> 20:23.950
<b><i>Whaaat?</i></b>

20:24.450 --> 20:25.490
<b>Yup.</b>

20:25.910 --> 20:28.490
<b>I couldn't go out
with someone younger.</b>

20:28.990 --> 20:30.200
<b>Really?</b>

20:30.200 --> 20:33.080
<b>It felt like he was looking
for a mature woman,</b>

20:32.370 --> 20:35.500
<b>ALTHOUGH
IT'S MY FAULT</b>

20:33.080 --> 20:35.500
<b>so I couldn't just let myself
depend on him.</b>

20:35.500 --> 20:42.260
<b>MATURE WOMAN</b>

20:36.130 --> 20:39.130
<b>I was told that he didn't get
what I was thinking,</b>

20:39.130 --> 20:42.260
<b>so dating a younger guy was hard for me.</b>

20:42.260 --> 20:48.350
<b>WHY IS THAT...</b>

20:42.760 --> 20:45.430
<b>Hey, but I think you
will be just fine, Akane.</b>

20:45.430 --> 20:46.300
<b>You don't
mean that,</b>

20:46.300 --> 20:47.600
<b>because it's not
your problem?</b>

20:47.600 --> 20:48.890
<b>Well, it isn't my problem.</b>

20:48.890 --> 20:54.770
<b>NO FAIR!!</b>

20:48.890 --> 20:54.770
<b>MATURE WOMAN</b>

20:49.310 --> 20:51.980
<b>Hey, Akane! Would you
mind not acting depressed</b>

20:51.980 --> 20:53.520
<b>in front of a single woman like me?</b>

20:54.230 --> 20:55.350
<b>Forgive me.</b>

20:56.360 --> 20:57.360
<b>Well, it's okay.</b>

20:57.150 --> 21:01.280
<b>BEING SINGLE IS FUN, TOO</b>

20:57.860 --> 21:01.280
<b>I knew that you two would end up
together sooner or later.</b>

21:01.610 --> 21:02.490
<b>You did?</b>

21:02.990 --> 21:05.160
<b>Yeah. You gave off
that kind of scent.</b>

21:05.160 --> 21:06.160
<b>Scent?</b>

21:06.570 --> 21:09.660
<b>Did I really seem
like I was throwing myself at Yamada?</b>

21:09.660 --> 21:11.790
<b>I CAN'T TELL MYSELF...</b>

21:10.740 --> 21:11.790
<b>No, no.</b>

21:13.870 --> 21:15.290
<b>The exact opposite!</b>

21:17.880 --> 21:21.460
<b>So anyway, in other words,
what I'm trying to say is...</b>

21:21.960 --> 21:24.130
<b>you'll be taking
your entrance exams soon, right?</b>

21:24.130 --> 21:26.260
<b>I know that you're
really going to be swamped,</b>

21:26.260 --> 21:29.180
<b>so you don't have to worry about me, okay?</b>

21:29.180 --> 21:32.680
<b>MATURE WOMAN</b>

21:29.850 --> 21:32.680
<b>I'll try not to be a burden on you...</b>

21:33.390 --> 21:36.770
<b>but once in a while,
like when you're tired,</b>

21:36.770 --> 21:38.650
<b>you can lean on me, all right?</b>

21:38.650 --> 21:40.440
<b>Can you at least pretend to be listening?</b>

21:40.860 --> 21:42.690
<b>No, I was listening.</b>

21:42.690 --> 21:45.910
<b>At least until you said that thing
about people supporting each other.</b>

21:45.910 --> 21:48.030
<b>That was way back at the beginning.</b>

21:48.030 --> 21:51.700
<b>It was around that point
that I started to lose you.</b>

21:52.700 --> 21:56.330
<b>While I was looking
at your mouth moving open and shut,</b>

21:56.330 --> 21:58.830
<b>I noticed that your canine teeth
are pretty sharp.</b>

21:59.290 --> 22:00.130
<b>Huh?</b>

22:01.000 --> 22:03.510
<b>And I was gazing at them,
thinking how cute they were.</b>

22:03.510 --> 22:04.340
<b>You're...</b>

22:07.470 --> 22:08.840
<b>You're teasing me, aren't you?</b>

22:09.350 --> 22:10.300
<b>No, not at all.</b>

22:10.470 --> 22:11.560
<b>MATURE WOMAN</b>

22:11.560 --> 22:16.060
<b>STOP STOP</b>

22:12.680 --> 22:15.100
<b><i>This mature woman thing isn't working.</i></b>

22:16.690 --> 22:17.690
<b>I'll walk you home.</b>

22:18.190 --> 22:19.020
<b>Thanks.</b>

22:25.320 --> 22:26.490
<b>- So—
- Yes?</b>

22:27.240 --> 22:29.700
<b>What was it
that you wanted to say just now?</b>

22:29.990 --> 22:31.200
<b>I'VE BEEN PONDERING
THE WHOLE TIME</b>

22:32.870 --> 22:33.700
<b>Um...</b>

22:34.700 --> 22:36.210
<b>actually...</b>

22:38.830 --> 22:43.000
<b>I said that I wanted to hold hands
when we're walking together.</b>

22:46.510 --> 22:47.340
<b>Hey...</b>

22:48.470 --> 22:49.300
<b>sorry about that.</b>

22:55.470 --> 22:57.940
<b>Wasn't that a cryptic way of telling me?</b>

22:58.730 --> 23:00.310
<b>I'll work on that.</b>

23:00.860 --> 23:01.770
<b>That would be great.</b>

23:06.190 --> 23:08.610
<b><i>What is this, a shoe?</i></b>

23:09.530 --> 23:12.070
<b><i>It must be a shoe, I guess.</i></b>

23:13.200 --> 23:15.540
<b><i>Does this even function as a shoe?</i></b>

23:16.160 --> 23:20.040
<b><i>Nah, it turned out like that
because it malfunctioned.</i></b>

23:21.330 --> 23:23.460
<b><i>If you're going
to crumple up on the ground...</i></b>

23:24.710 --> 23:27.550
<b><i>then you should wear
normal shoes that work.</i></b>

23:29.680 --> 23:32.510
<b><i>I just don't get them. Women...</i></b>

23:33.850 --> 23:35.100
<b>Are you all right?</b>
